      "evidence_id": "EV_001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Um, hello. I've had diarrhoea, I'm sorry to say, for ten days now, since I got back from holiday. It's not stopping.",
