    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Persistent traveller's diarrhoea after ten days, I'd say it's likely a gut infection picked up abroad, possibly a parasite like giardia, though bacteria are also possible.",
